\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Replay pool}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{replay}

\p{At update index #{n}, a \strong{replay pool} #{\mathcal R_n} is a finite
multiset of immutable rollout records eligible for selection. Its management
rule specifies insertion, eviction, and any partition by task or behavior
stamp.}

\p{The pool is persistent state of the training protocol. It is not the
minibatch selected for one update.}
